  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ALESSANDRO BIANCHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alessandro Bianchi is the founder of SportsPro and an Italian individual with a passion for sports, particularly football, and a deep connection to his Italian heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPORTSPRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SportsPro is a UK-based sports business magazine known for its in-depth analysis and coverage of the sports industry, with a particular focus on Italian football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MILAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Milan is the city where Alessandro Bianchi's office is located, and it is the fashion capital of Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUOMO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Duomo is a famous landmark in Milan, symbolizing the city's rich cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VESPA SCOOTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vespa scooters are a common sight in Milan, reflecting the city's urban landscape and transportation methods."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UK is the base of operations for SportsPro, where the magazine is headquartered in London."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LONDON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"London is the capital city of the UK and the headquarters of SportsPro, serving as a hub for sports business and media."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPORTSPRO MEDIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SportsPro Media is the parent company of SportsPro, responsible for its operations and management."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOPHIA PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sophia Patel is the deputy editor of SportsPro, a British individual who brings a strong connection to the UK market to the magazine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN FOOTBALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Italian Football is the subject of a feature article in SportsPro, highlighting the country's football renaissance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPORTS BUSINESS AWARDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sports Business Awards is an event where SportsPro won the 'Best Sports Business Publication' award in 2019."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sports Business Awards is an event where organizations and individuals in the sports industry are recognized for their achievements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sports Business Awards is an event where organizations and individuals in the sports industry are recognized for their achievements.")</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPORTSPRO OFFICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SportsPro Office is the physical space where Alessandro Bianchi works, located in Milan."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPORTS INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sports Industry encompasses the commercial aspects of sports, which is the primary focus of SportsPro."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CALCIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Calcio is the term used in Italy to refer to football, highlighting the cultural significance of the sport in the country."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FEATURE ARTICLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Feature Article is a section in SportsPro dedicated to in-depth analysis and stories, such as the 'Rise of Italian Football' feature."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPORTS PRO TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sports Pro Team is the editorial team of SportsPro, consisting of experienced journalists and industry experts."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOOTBALL RENAISSANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Football Renaissance is the period of growth and revival in Italian football, which SportsPro aims to highlight."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASSION FOR SPORTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Passion for Sports is a driving force behind Alessandro Bianchi's creation of SportsPro and his dedication to the magazine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH ACCENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"British Accent is a characteristic of Sophia Patel, reflecting her connection to the UK market."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TREPIDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trepidation is a feeling of nervousness and caution that Alessandro's team experiences during their work on SportsPro."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STRONG TIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Strong Ties are the connections between SportsPro and the UK market, highlighted by Sophia Patel's involvement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IN-DEPTH ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"In-depth Analysis is a hallmark of SportsPro's content, providing detailed insights into the sports industry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INSIGHTFUL CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Insightful Content is the type of material SportsPro produces, offering valuable perspectives on the sports industry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENGAGING CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Engaging Content is another aspect of SportsPro's offerings, designed to captivate and inform readers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN FLAIR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Italian Flair is what sets SportsPro apart from competitors, reflecting its roots in Italian culture."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL SPORTS JOURNALISTS ASSOCIATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The International Sports Journalists Association is an organization involved in reporting and possibly organizing awards."&lt;SEP&gt;"The International Sports Journalists Association is an organization involved in reporting and possibly organizing awards.")</data>
